+/**
+ * Computes the 11 pivot levels for the given chart style from the previous
+ * anchor period's high/low/close (and open, for DeMark).
+ *
+ * Returns `[PP, R1, S1, R2, S2, R3, S3, R4, S4, R5, S5]`.
