    tickerid, basecurrency, currency, mintick, pointvalue, pricescale,
    minmove, timezone, session, volumetype, root, prefix, main_tickerid,
    current_contract, type, description, mincontract, plus getSymbolInfo.
  - Each reads from the active session's `SymbolInfo`; returns the
    type-appropriate empty value (NaN for numbers, "" for strings) when
    the provider did not supply the field.
